{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Temporal.Span</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"hegel","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Hegel","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Generators","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Temporal","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Span","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Calendar spans.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.years\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.years\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>years : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.months\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.months\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>months : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.weeks\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.weeks\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>weeks : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.days\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.days\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>days : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.hours\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.hours\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>hours : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.minutes\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.minutes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>minutes : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.seconds\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.seconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>seconds : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.milliseconds\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.milliseconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>milliseconds : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.microseconds\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.microseconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>microseconds : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.nanoseconds\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.nanoseconds\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>nanoseconds : int;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A signed count of each unit from years to nanoseconds. Units are not normalized: 90 minutes stays 90 minutes. Generated spans use one sign for all units unless drawn with <code>~sign:`Mixed</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-to_string\"><a href=\"#val-to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>to_string span</code> lists nonzero units from largest to smallest: <code>1y 2mo 3w 4d 5h 6m 7s 8ms 9µs 10ns</code>, with one leading <code>-</code> when no unit is positive (<code>-3d 4h</code> is minus three days and minus four hours), a sign on every unit when the signs are mixed (<code>-3d +4h</code>), and <code>0s</code> for zero.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pp\"><a href=\"#val-pp\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pp : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Format.formatter <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>pp formatter span</code> prints <code>to_string span</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sexp_of_t\"><a href=\"#val-sexp_of_t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sexp_of_t : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Sexplib0</span>.Sexp.t</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>sexp_of_t span</code> is <code>to_string span</code> as an atom.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-equal\"><a href=\"#val-equal\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> equal : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>equal a b</code> compares fields. Equivalent lengths expressed in different units are not equal.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compare\"><a href=\"#val-compare\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compare : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>compare a b</code> is a total order consistent with <a href=\"#val-equal\"><code>equal</code></a>, comparing the units largest first. It does not order spans by length.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-hegel_generator\"><a href=\"#val-hegel_generator\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> hegel_generator : <span><span>(<a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>, <a href=\"../../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>spans ()</code>, every unit drawn over its whole range.</p></div></div>"}